      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "As Rene gets the crew ready for the first scene of the day, star actor Stanis La Rochelle strolls onto the Studio 2 set fresh from a tennis match. After Arianna reminds Stanis about his contract, he spots Alessandro and decides the intern needs a brand-new name. Listen to the Italian scene first; you do not need to catch every word.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "stanis",
      "t": "Che straordinario odore di set! Mi sento a casa.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stanis",
      "t": "Appena posso, mollo questa serie.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stanis",
      "t": "Sto scherzando! Sto in gran forma.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "arianna",
      "t": "Ciao Stanis, come stai?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
